Name: Open in StatDataViewer
Description: Send the selected expression, or the object under the cursor, to StatDataViewer.
Binding: sdv_addin_view
Interactive: false

Name: Open object in StatDataViewer...
Description: Type an object name or R expression to send to StatDataViewer.
Binding: sdv_addin_prompt
Interactive: false

Name: Open Global Environment in StatDataViewer
Description: List every object in the global environment (kind, class, dimensions, size, value) in StatDataViewer.
Binding: sdv_addin_env
Interactive: false
